   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Rio Grande City, Texas, USA - February 9, 2016: A Border Patrol agent searches for illegal aliens along the banks of the Rio Grande River in the Rio Grande Valley in far south Texas. A continuous game of cat and mouse plays out along the river twenty four hours a day.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
